WEBVTT

00:07:56.038 --> 00:08:01.954
and abuse. And the second one was my mom
is a single mom and we were very poor.

00:08:01.954 --> 00:08:03.538
We were poor with my dad too,

00:08:03.913 --> 00:08:07.746
but really living in poverty with
a single mom and three kids and

00:08:08.163 --> 00:08:09.829
a lot of chaos and disarray,

00:08:09.829 --> 00:08:14.913
but but also a lot of light and joy
and fun and no longer being under

00:08:14.913 --> 00:08:20.413
the the sort of weight of that fear that
you have when you live with somebody

00:08:20.413 --> 00:08:21.413
who's abusive.

00:08:22.413 --> 00:08:26.496
I completely understand in many ways.

00:08:26.496 --> 00:08:30.746
I had a lot of similar experiences
so that a lot of